        method        "DERIVED from a fit: omega = -log10(Psat(0.7 Tc)/Pc) - 1 from the Antoine the vapour-pressure pipeline fitted (data/curation/components/NMethyl13Diaminopropane) and the measured Tc, Pc; 0.7 Tc = 420.60 K, inside the fitted range";
